    "report_content": "<p><strong>X-ray chest PA view</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>Findings:</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\tPosition and outline of the trachea is normal.</p><p>\tBoth hemidiaphragms are normal in position, contour and definition.</p><p>\tArea just below the diaphragm are normal. </p><p>\tHeart is normal in transverse diameter.</p><p>\tRoots of the great vessels are normal. </p><p>\tBoth lung fields are normal. </p><p>\tDensity, position and shape of the hila are normal. </p><p>\tNo hilar lymphadenopathy is noted.</p><p>\tNo mediastinal displacement is seen. </p><p>Bony areas appear insignificant. </p><p>\tSoft tissue of the chest cage showed no abnormality. </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>IMPRESSION: </strong></p><p><strong>No significant abnormality noted. </strong></p><p><strong><u>&nbsp;</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>&nbsp;</u></strong></p>",
